{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t香港仔隧道往灣仔方向管道內發生交通意外，涉及兩架私家車及一架旅遊巴，意外中無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發於今早近8時，警方表示，當時涉事兩架私家車在管道快線行駛，其後相撞，其中一架私家車再撞到正在慢線行駛的一架旅遊巴。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:20:31.891407+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T01:55:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:01.870159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:10.923523+00:00","content_hash":"9a9896f55787730e3b227be14f31e0e80851fab84adee3653c9e88013e2c2a1d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}